# Keep the Docker build context small and free of secrets / host-built artefacts.
# Host node_modules are Windows/macOS builds and must never reach a Linux image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/generated
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets and runtime data
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets
**/browser-profiles
**/storage
infra/.env.prod
infra/certs
infra/backups
infra/letsencrypt

# Not needed to build api/web
docs
*.md
!apps/web/README.md
